<body class="sp-page">
  <%- include('partials/modern-header') %>
  <main>
    <section class="sp-hero"><div class="modern-inner sp-hero-inner"><p class="sp-eyebrow">The FushidaLanka standard</p><h1>Built on trust.<br><span>Made for the work.</span></h1><p>A trusted source for tools, building materials and hardware solutions since 2010.</p></div></section>
    <section class="sp-section" id="story"><div class="modern-inner sp-grid-2"><div><p class="sp-eyebrow">Our story</p><h2>Good work starts with <span>good hardware.</span></h2></div><div class="sp-lead"><p>FushidaLanka began as a small hardware shop with a vision to provide quality tools and materials. Today, we are a comprehensive hardware supplier serving residential, commercial and industrial clients across Sri Lanka.</p><p>Our journey is driven by quality, practical advice and customer satisfaction. We help homeowners, tradespeople, contractors and businesses choose dependable products for work that lasts.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="sp-section alt"><div class="modern-inner sp-grid-2"><article class="sp-card"><span class="sp-number">01</span><h3>Our mission</h3><p>To make dependable hardware easier to source through genuine products, fair pricing and practical support for every kind of project.</p></article><article class="sp-card"><span class="sp-number">02</span><h3>Our vision</h3><p>To be Sri Lanka’s most trusted hardware partner, recognized for product quality, honest guidance and service that stays close to the work.</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="sp-section dark"><div class="modern-inner"><p class="sp-eyebrow">The people behind the work</p><h2>Meet the <span>team.</span></h2><p class="sp-dark-copy">A practical team dedicated to helping you source with confidence.</p><div class="sp-grid-3" style="margin-top:34px"><article class="sp-card dark-card"><img class="sp-team-image" src="/images/avatar-placeholder.svg" alt="FushidaLanka team"><h3>FushidaLanka Team</h3><p>Founder & Managing Director</p><p>Leads the company vision and keeps the customer experience grounded in quality and trust.</p></article><article class="sp-card dark-card"><img class="sp-team-image" src="/images/avatar-placeholder.svg" alt="Technical team"><h3>Technical Team</h3><p>Product & Technical Support</p><p>Helps customers select the right products and specifications for each job.</p></article><article class="sp-card dark-card"><img class="sp-team-image" src="/images/avatar-placeholder.svg" alt="Customer support team"><h3>Customer Support Team</h3><p>Sales & Project Support</p><p>Helps homeowners, tradespeople and project teams plan practical purchases within budget.</p></article></div></div></section>
  </main>
